range synth1 pitch -17.179 1.821 sounds good from C1 to G2 (key -12 .. +7)
range synth1 drive 0 0.05 how aggressive the boiling sounds
range synth1 reverb 0 1 radiating power at 1, small and contained at 0
range synth1 phaser 0 1 subtle; the phaser rate adds a rhythmic element
range synth1 ph_stages 3 5
range synth3 pitch -20.033 3.967 key -12 .. +12; avoid gather (harsh); reverb and flange are the power and rhythm knobs
range synth3 reverb 0 1 power
range synth3 flange 0 1 rhythm
range synth8 pitch -12.416 11.584 key -12 (C2) .. +12 (C4); harsh above +7, like something is about to pop
range synth8 gather 0 1 takes chords well at 1
range synth8 reverb 0 1
range synth8 phaser 0 1 avoid touching drive
range tones level 0 0.25 subtle background layer, about 20% of the synth loops
range tones drive 0 0.2
range tones gather 0 1
range cloud level 0 0.65 dramatic; emphasis when tones is not enough
range cloud gather 0 1 the biggest lever: THX deep-note sweep 0 to 1; clearest chord player at 1
range fire pitch -9.416 14.584 key -12 .. +12
range fire drive 0 0.2 intensity; avoid the other sliders
range lava pitch -15.756 8.244 key -12 .. +12, faint at either end but never harsh
range lava drive 0 0.2 intensity; avoid the other sliders
range torch level 0 0.8 intensity through level, not drive; the loop is dense, use the turn-on / turn-off one-shots as transitions
range torch cutoff 0.2 0.7 the 440 Hz bandpass keys it; pitch shifts do nothing
bind arm1.pitch synth3 pitch 0 12 rel
bind arm2.pitch synth8 pitch 0 12 rel
bind arm3.pitch tones pitch 0 12 rel
bind arm1.reach synth3 level 0 0.7
bind arm2.reach synth8 level 0 0.8
bind arm3.reach tones level 0 0.25
bind radiance synth1 reverb
bind radiance synth3 reverb
bind radiance synth8 reverb
bind consonance cloud gather
bind tension synth1 drive
bind drive synth1 level 0.45 0.8
note Starting assignment, to be argued with by ear: synth1 is the always-on bed (crank drive brings it up, tension makes it boil),
note synth3 / synth8 / tones each follow one arm's pitch and reach. The beds could instead be shared by all arms and crossfaded by a
note signal (bind tension synth1 level 0.8 0 next to bind tension synth3 level 0 0.7 is a crossfade) so the sound evolves as you tune.
note Reward layers (fire, lava, torch) stay low in the palette; each spell's signature brings its own up. coherence is unbound so far.
